OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAnother band
OL,6,Fof heavy rain moving into western
OL,7,Fareas through the evening, spreading
OL,8,Feastwards across the rest of the UK
OL,9,Fovernight. Widely very windy, with
OL,10,Fsevere gales across northwest
OL,11,FScotland. A much milder night to come,
OL,12,Fespecially in the east.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FEarly rain clearing to sunny
OL,15,Fspells and showers. Showers heaviest
OL,16,Fand most frequent in the northwest.
OL,17,FAnother windy day, with severe gales
OL,18,Facross parts of Scotland in
OL,19,Fparticular. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
